     4900   on value-changed of a-n-c in frame d-pr-doc do:
     4901     run proc-valchg-a-n-c in this-procedure  no-error.
     4902     return no-apply.
     4903   end.
     4904   on any-printable of br-list in frame d-pr-doc do:
     4905     run proc-any-printable-br-list in this-procedure   no-error.
     4906     return no-apply.
